sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Accountant
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant Policy
  participant Workflow
  participant Audit
  Accountant->>UI: Inspect evidence and consequences
  UI->>API: Approve, reject or modify proposal
  API->>Policy: Verify owner, current version and valid state
  Policy->>Workflow: Accept permitted decision
  Workflow->>Audit: Record actor, version and evidence
  Workflow->>UI: Approved handoff or rejected/revised state
  UI->>Accountant: Show status and next action
